OL,3,ATeenager jailed for life over ambush
OL,4,Amurder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who travelled more than 150
OL,7,Fmiles from Leeds to London to stab a
OL,8,Fman has been jailed for at least 25
OL,9,Fyears for his murder.
OL,11,FSulaiman Tajzai, 18, ambushed shop
OL,12,Fworker Farmanullah Sherzad outside the
OL,13,F26-year-old's home in Westminster on 27
OL,14,FMarch, stabbing him at least 10 times.
OL,16,FSentencing him at the Old Bailey to a
OL,17,Flife term, Judge Angela Rafferty KC
OL,18,Fsaid he had held a grudge against
OL,19,FSherzad "based on a false suggestion of
OL,20,Fmisconduct" and had been "effectively
OL,21,Fstalking him down like prey".
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
